{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter's New Job", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Talking About the Project", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Giving and Understand Oral Instructions ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Both in the workplace and in our everyday lives, it is important to ask for instructions as well as to give them. <br><br>The chart below summarizes the most important language you can use. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Asking For Instructions</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Giving Instructions</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>How do you (do this)?</li> <li>How do I ... (verb) ?</li> <li>What is the best way to ... (verb) ?</li> <li>How do I go about it?</li> <li>What do you suggest?</li> <li>Is this about ... ?</li> <li>What do you see me doing ... ?</li> <li>And then?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I would like you to \u2026 (verb)</li> <li>In my experience, the best way to do it is by \u2026 </li> <li>You need to \u2026 (verb). This is what we call \u2026 I would start by \u2026 (ing)</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Sequencing</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Continuing</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>First, (you) ...</li><li> Then, (you) \u2026 </li><li>Next, (you) \u2026</li><li> Lastly, (you) \u2026 </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Once you've done that, the next thing I want you to do is to \u2026 </li><li>After that, \u2026</li><li> The next step is to ...</li><li> When you finish that, then ...</li><li> The last step is to \u2026 </li><li>The last thing you do is ... </li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">I would like you to</span> find out more about that company.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " <span class=\"strong\">How do I go about</span> do<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> it? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">In my experience, the best way to do it is</span> by scheduling an appointment with them. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">And then</span>? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">After that, I would like you to</span> keep track of their media activity.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Talking about Work Experience", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " In the Business World, when you are in an interview for a job, it is important to talk about work experience and what you have and haven't done before.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect Tense</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We use the Present Perfect (<span class=\"italic\">have</span> + past participle) to describe and talk about experience:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>She <span class=\"strong\">hasn't worked in</span> marketing.</li> <li>She <span class=\"strong\">has worked in</span> a few PR companies.</li> <li><span class=\"strong\">Have</span> you us<span class=\"strong\">ed</span> this software before?</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Have experience of / with</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can also talk about experience using the expression <span class=\"italic\">have experience of</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>I<span class=\"strong\"> have a lot of experience</span> work<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> with customers.</li> <li>I <span class=\"strong\">have no experience with</span> advertising.</li> <li>Do you <span class=\"strong\">have any experience of</span> deal<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> with clients?</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <span class=\"strong\">Be Familiar with</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can also use the expression <span class=\"italic\">be familiar with</span> to describe something you know because you learned about it or experienced it before. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li><span class=\"strong\">Are</span> you <span class=\"strong\">familiar with</span> this particular software?</li> <li>She'<span class=\"strong\">s familiar  with</span> the problems we're having.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "consultant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone whose job is to give advice on a particular subject", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have worked as a PR consultant before.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when talking about work experience. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "rundown", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a quick report or explanation of something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would like to give you a rundown of this new assignment.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " project ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a carefully planned piece of work to do something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This is a major project for our firm.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to embark on  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to start something new", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We are about to embark on an exciting journey.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "public image ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the ideas and opinions that the public has about a person or an organization  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They want to improve their public image.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "publicity", "type": "name"}, {"content": " attention in magazines, newspapers, or television ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We need to create publicity for their new clothing line. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to keep track of", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be fully aware; to be informed of  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need to keep track of their social media. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Make a list of 5 jobs. Write each job down on a piece of paper.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For each job, think of the kind of work experience that someone that has the job would have. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 2 sentences related to work experience for each on a separate piece of paper.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Place the papers upside down so you can't see the words or sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Turn one paper over to see the word or sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Turn another paper over. If they are a match, you take the par. If they are not a match, you place them upside down again.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Continue until all the papers are taken.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write down the names of different jobs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about work experience.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I match a job with its experience.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le04ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le04ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le04ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Miranda, before we start, I would like to ask about your experience. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I have worked as a PR consultant before, and have some experience of working with clients internationally.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Excellent. I'd like to give you a rundown on this major project we are about to embark on. Have you read the memo I sent?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I haven't read it yet, but I scanned through it briefly. Is this about Holly's?"}, {"image": "engenn6le04ob03re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "24000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Correct! They've decided to hire an agency to improve their public image as well as creating publicity for their new clothing line.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Sounds exciting. What exactly do you see me doing on this project?  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I would like you to do some research on Farmani. In my experience, the best way to do it is by setting up an appointment with him.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: OK. I can do that. And then?"}, {"image": "engenn6le04ob03re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "47300", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Once you've done that, the next thing I want you to do is find out as much as you can about Holly's.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>:  Got it. How do I go about that?  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: You need to keep track of their social media. This is what we call monitoring coverage. We use it to get a better insight into the company's image.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Gotcha! I'm going to get started on this right away."}], "coverimg": "engenn6le04ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can talk about work experience.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can give and understand oral instructions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  Do you work? Where? What do you do? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What kind of work experience do you have?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " What's on the agenda today?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " \nJanet talks to Miranda about a <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">major</span> project that's coming up. \n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": [{"content": " <span class=\"italic\">\u201cMajor\u201d</span> means very large or important. The opposite of  <span class=\"italic\">\u201cmajor\u201d</span> is  <span class=\"italic\">minor</span>.", "type": "text", "tip_id": 0}], "type": "tips"}, {"contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "type": "STI", "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}]}, {"id": 2, "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Let's talk about work experience.", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", 